{"article_id": "L003-A0040", "source_id": "L003", "version_id": "L003-6b29f63c629d", "number": 40, "start": 6190, "end": 6329, "text": "　　第四十条  销售财产保险产品、一年期以下人身保险产品的，可以免于开展投保人需求及财务支付水平评估，按需收集投保人、保险标的等相关信息。\n\n　　团体保险可以免于开展投保人需求及财务支付水平评估；涉及可能导致本金损失产品的团体保险，应当对拟交纳保费的自然人开展风险承受能力评估。", "text_sha256": "01adaedf59454962e8e9fb4559da59d6c8fcd73e63527aa75c8178454254cea4", "complete": true, "representation": "existing_official_reader_text_extract_not_original_html_pdf", "origin_file": "C:\\Users\\11051\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-10-09\\c-users-11051-desktop-agent-ai\\outputs\\FinRisk_法规库V1_20261017\\articles.jsonl", "source_text_file": "C:\\Users\\11051\\Documents\\Codex\\2026-10-09\\c-users-11051-desktop-agent-ai\\outputs\\FinRisk_法规库V1_20261017\\sources\\texts.jsonl", "original_source_text_sha256": "167541970d7d7bdd588d4db5b98e893dc590c23d34a2ea6fa4b8ddcb2286caed", "production_active": false, "purpose": "delivery dependency for L003-A0046; added after fixed boundary trial, not used in its scores"}
